Package: ticpu-claude-command-hook
Version: 0.0.0-replaced-by-makefile
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 0.0), libgcc-s1
Installed-Size: 0
Maintainer: Jérôme Poulin <jeromepoulin@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ticpu/ticpu-claude-command-hook
Description: Claude Code hook dispatcher
 Single binary backing every Claude Code hook entry: permission guards over
 Bash commands and file edits, plus the gf search-output folder it pipes
 searches through. Run "ticpu-claude-command-hook install" once per user to
 write the settings.json entries.
